lines:
Hiya! Are you maybe...
A rookie Trainer?{be01}
Do you know what Pokémon Trainers
do when they reach a new town?{be01}
They first check what kind of Gym
is in the town.

My face is reflected in the water.{be01}
It’s a shining grin full of hope...{be01}
Or it could be a look of somber silence
struggling with fear...{be01}
What do you see reflected in your face?

Wally: {0100:0}...
Pokémon hide in tall grass like this,{be00}
don’t they?{be01}
Please watch me and see if I can
catch one properly.{be01}
...Whoa!

…… …… ……{be01}
嗯，也不一定。
衣服看起来挺干净的……{be01}
可能是个新人训练家，
或者只个普通的孩子。

嗨！莫非你是……
新人训练家？{be01}
你知道一位训练家来到
新城镇时首先要做什么吗？{be01}
他们会去看看那里
有什么样的道馆。
